The MIT terms above cover the source code of this repository.

They do not cover the card illustrations in public/art/. Those are made from photographs
published on Wikimedia Commons, most of them under a share-alike licence, so the illustrations
are published under CC BY-SA 4.0 rather than the terms above. Each one names its photograph, its
photographer and that photograph's own licence in public/art/CREDITS.md, and the same list is
shown in the game.

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Everything else in public/ -- the music, the backgrounds, the card frames, the icons and the mod
illustrations -- is the copyright holder's own work and is covered by the MIT terms above, as the
CREDITS.md file in each folder records.

